AssertionError: expected '2023-02-02 19:02:17.224+00' to be an instance of Date

Environment


Sequelize version: 7.0.0-alpha.21 ... Also happens in 7.0.0-alpha.20. It does not happen in 7.0.0-alpha.10
Node.js version: v18.13.0
If TypeScript related: TypeScript version: 4.9.4 not related
Database & Version: postgres 15 for my code, default postgres in sscce
Connector library & Version: pg 8.9.0 and pg-hstore, since it won't run without it at all

Would you be willing to resolve this issue by submitting a Pull Request?


