Make css id "compressable"
Currently our css can be reduced 3x in gzip/brotli by just using compressable ids.
That can be done during publish step, by simple algorithm like
const uncompressable2Compressable = {};

for(const style of styles) {
  uncompressable2Compressable[style.id] =   uncompressable2Compressable[style.id] ?? `a${counter++}`;
  newStyles.push([uncompressable2Compressable[style.id], style.value])
}


PS:
Why publish step and not use compressable initially - because if we want collaborative editing we need some random ids, they can be not random but like {user_id}_{compressable_style_id} but above solution looks easier vs changing id generation

