At this point, vscode is running with the extensions as expected.
Rebuilding doesn't change this in case I don't touch my vscode config.
But if I change anything about vscode in my config, say, add another extension, and rebuild, the extensions are all unloaded (or likely more precise, vscode is reloaded without the extensions?), and restarting vscode or rebooting doesn't change that.
In this case, I've added vscode-extensions.github.github-vscode-theme to programs.vscode.extensions.

