[FEA] Performing device-to-device copies with thrust::copy is synchronous with `par_nosync`. Can this be improved?
Is this a duplicate?

 I confirmed there appear to be no duplicate issues for this request and that I agree to the Code of Conduct

Area
Thrust
Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.
The underlying function trivial_copy_device_to_device is always synchronous, as it does not use cuda_cub::synchronize_optional.



      cccl/thrust/thrust/system/cuda/detail/util.h


        Lines 165 to 180
      in
      ee9b856







           THRUST_RUNTIME_FUNCTION cudaError_t 




           trivial_copy_device_to_device(Policy& policy, Type* dst, Type const* src, size_t count) 




           { 




             cudaError_t status = cudaSuccess; 




             if (count == 0) 




             { 




               return status; 




             } 









             cudaStream_t stream = cuda_cub::stream(policy); 




             // 




             status = ::cudaMemcpyAsync(dst, src, sizeof(Type) * count, cudaMemcpyDeviceToDevice, stream); 




             cuda_cub::synchronize(policy); 




             return status; 




           } 










This can also lead to unexpected synchronization in other places, for example thrust::sort will perform a copy internally and thus synchronize.
#include <thrust/sort.h>
#include <thrust/device_vector.h>
#include <thrust/execution_policy.h>

void func(size_t n){
    thrust::device_vector<int> vec(n);
    thrust::sort(thrust::cuda::par_nosync,vec.begin(), vec.end());
}

int main(){
    func(1024*1024);
}

Describe the solution you'd like
D2D copies should be asynchronous with par_nosync
Describe alternatives you've considered
No response
Additional context
At the time of implementing par_nosync (NVIDIA/thrust#1568) there were some places where synchronization was optional in host code, and mandatory in CDP device code and thus left as mandatory in host code as well.
With the changes during the last years , deprecating CDP1 and making thrust algorithms sequential in device code, I wonder if more syncs could be made optional as well.

